itle":"春日五首 其三","author":"秦观","text":"裌衣新著倦琴书，散策池塘返照初。\n翠碧黄鹂相续去，荇丝深处见游鱼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":58497,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日五首 其一","author":"秦观","text":"幅巾投晓入西园，春动林塘物物鲜。\n却憩小庭才日出，海棠花发麝香眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":58498,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日五首 其二","author":"秦观","text":"一夕轻雷落万丝，霁光浮瓦碧差差。\n有情芍药含春泪，无力蔷薇卧晓枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":58499,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日偶题呈上尚书丈丈","author":"秦观","text":"三年京国鬓如丝，又见新花发故枝。\n日典春衣非为酒，家贫食粥已多时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":58500,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春词绝句五首 其五","author":"秦观","text":"颠毛渐脱风情少，匣剑空存侠气销。\n人远地偏无酒肉，春深花鸟谩相撩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":58501,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春词绝句五首 其四","author":"秦观","text":"风驱白雨洗园林，蔽地飞花一寸深。\n狂紫浪红俱已矣，老春虽在亦何心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":58502,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春词绝句五首 其三","author":"秦观","text":"都城春富百花披，长忆人归驻马时。\n浅色御